i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r6MYpYgZ_PYQ7kNvwE9hN3m&_nc_oc=AdrQMQUr516BvLSdL1vi8BM1_kyyJNrX8ikFEzKUMvJ7mOqnho13td2rOjb-i9wHGE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9QsKYABuYe-Uo1RlweQAZvyQz04JDwcdMwOqHH4D9WDQ&oe=6A36ACE6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Q1VE6fHMEYQ7kNvwF3Pw5Y&_nc_oc=AdpgxT8mC__N0mncoIq5yP_04_08x-xsk1ne_Iuv5lr-1Dp9y7wwBo08tWVoyi1cDeU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-5SRuofnCimqPXTPNnytK4qStW5EZYzWpxyW-vdI4nWw&oe=6A36A232"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivIK6GtFRXkQ7kNvwETX99T&_nc_oc=AdqBoyHOROkBKHHNVd7gAo9jeOUg6lpGN9p8a1Z4X5C5O5W3L4h7xEEcppbC6JoVMWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_cqSYziGOEa-5vr3HMFLIAshWGO7h3IufB_jOXiagL7A&oe=6A369BFB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TI2-Bi4JZroQ7kNvwFah2Zt&_nc_oc=AdpTNVKc4r2Eyl0-ulgXwBgC7AVqS3-aGbKOo2Qkt9ooWExYCx_u85BlIkfBMjp7Mnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-24kXJbjxI0Mx0IRramDwpjusDm_Arq5JsXnaOwMboLQ&oe=6A36B173"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ziI2UDQahXsQ7kNvwFBKyHP&_nc_oc=AdqgGjV7NCNp8kxiwxjzQZO4Vc0MbvaLwUipDdyCPS7fXyOckA_O96IhlEmT5H9LiCo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_z-6U036qcgIhDGB-xJ2cEm0FfYujWenUJBtaQHRQo6w&oe=6A36AF72"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NSse-nuZiJ8Q7kNvwHDm4uA&_nc_oc=AdroVks5akx2PJjW8yrGWrxtye66Jjofgik6NBXELhJ7_gK96-dFQIzMk65G9DEaN3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_1FrzwxsQ5WUOBGz_rLf1jNaObDmE2tDvltyT58lAY_Q&oe=6A36A6D3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O5xkY5iyjRMQ7kNvwGAUorh&_nc_oc=AdrBhnRnwNLDUT9SpuuqSFJ7vi-azQFql34sP1WQ9bbqwMl_LLKdYG0KiNmKcIotoFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-3M6ELjLzoGZcUJKHb6lHTHF3B9X0A1leZG_1IytUuDA&oe=6A36A2EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uW13wfkkKicQ7kNvwE_YjPm&_nc_oc=AdpRdja9_DGWsTnsZicE4kQDTj2ZHp96QRzA8ITvik6pydFrfi9LmVIOPLbvL3bnfZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9J4-kFvOt8QvStEKfUjRLh7RaJNCfj_etbUnuqiY9Cxw&oe=6A36AEA2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_